# systemd's udev rules give /dev/rtc* and /dev/ptp* to the group "clock",
# which Buildroot 2026.08 does not create (udev: "Unknown group 'clock'").
# Backport of Buildroot master's cf669d53 (package/systemd: add clock group
# for PTP and RTC devices); drop this file once the pinned Buildroot has it.
- - clock -1 * - - - PTP and RTC device group
